# StratonHub Registry Rules (Delta Only)
Applies on top of `00-global.always.mdc`. Do NOT restate global rules.

## SSOT Contract
- Registry drives navigation, search, routes, and coverage.
- If it’s not in the registry, it doesn’t exist.

## Required Fields (Minimum)
- id, title, description, route
- surface, type, status
- tags, owner, updatedAt

## Hard Constraints
- id must be kebab-case and unique
- route must be unique
- route must match surface prefix:
  - /developers/*
  - /business/*
  - /users/*

## Change Rule
When changing registry:
- update registry entry + page route + metadata in the same PR.
